<title>USA: MidAmerican says board adopts rights plan.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican says board adopts rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Holdings Co said its board of directors adopted a shareholder rights plan at its meeting in Des Moines.</p>
<p>&quot;This action is not a response to any specific offer or threat of takeover aimed at MidAmerican,&quot; said the Iowa electric and natural gas utility holding company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
